 82	
 83	**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**
 84	- Same session (no context switch)
 85	- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)
 86	- Two-stage review after each task: spec compliance first, then code quality
 87	- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)
